# Copy to .env and adjust for your machine.
#
# LOCAL (Vite dev, http://localhost:5173): recommended setup
# - Do NOT set VITE_API_BASE_URL / VITE_API_URL so the app uses same-origin /api.
# - vite.config.ts proxies /api → FastAPI. Match uvicorn port:
VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8001
#
# If you must talk to the API host directly (CORS must allow your origin on the backend):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001
# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001/api

# Production (point at deployed backend)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.example.com/api

# VITE_USE_LOCAL=true  # uses 127.0.0.1:8001 from api.ts when not in Vite dev
